figures.caption_en:
Figure 3: CCC fits to the seven 33 benchmark galaxies, spanning early-type spirals (NGC 7814, Sab) through late-type discs to a gas-rich irregular (D631-7, Im). In each panel the black points are the observed rotation velocity \(V_{obs}\) with its uncertainty; the blue dashed curve is the SPARC baryonic velocity \(V_{b}\) (the fit target); the red solid curve is the smooth-CCC prediction \(V_{bX}\) (our fiducial, Eq. 18 ); and the green dotted curve is the sharp-CCC prediction using the published discontinuous turn-off. The smooth transition removes the kink the sharp law produces near the turn-off radius, tracking the baryonic curve more closely (clearest in NGC 1090 and NGC 3198). The per-galaxy reduced \(\chi^{2}_{
u}\) is annotated in each panel for both the smooth (sm) and sharp (sh) transitions. The small \(\chi^{2}_{
u}\) of some galaxies is genuine rather than anomalous: NGC 7814 ( \(\chi^{2}_{
u}=0.07\) ) has a \(V_{bX}\) prediction that hugs the baryonic points across the whole disc, while NGC 3521 ( \(0.08\) ) has large velocity uncertainties that propagate to a correspondingly generous prediction error, so agreement within that error yields \(\chi^{2}_{
u} 3.7 , identical to that used throughout the paper.

figures.caption_zh:
图3：CCC对七个33基准星系的拟合，涵盖从早型旋涡星系（NGC 7814，Sab）到晚型盘状星系，再到富含气体的不规则星系（D631-7，Im）。在每个面板中，黑点是观测旋转速度\(V_{obs}\)及其不确定性；蓝色虚线是SPARC重子速度\(V_{b}\)（拟合目标）；红色实线是平滑CCC预测\(V_{bX}\)（我们的基准，式18）；绿色点线是使用已发表的不连续截止的尖锐CCC预测。平滑过渡消除了尖锐定律在截止半径附近产生的扭结，更紧密地跟踪重子曲线（在NGC 1090和NGC 3198中最明显）。每个面板中标注了平滑（sm）和尖锐（sh）过渡的逐星系约化\(\chi^{2}_{
u}\)。一些星系的低\(\chi^{2}_{
u}\)是真实的而非异常：NGC 7814（\(\chi^{2}_{
u}=0.07\)）的\(V_{bX}\)预测在整个盘面上紧贴重子点，而NGC 3521（\(0.08\)）具有较大的速度不确定性，传播为相应的宽预测误差，因此在该误差内的一致性产生\(\chi^{2}_{
u} 3.7，与全文一致。

